{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/199821262af5cae4baf8d1fc3dd6825d.poster.avif?t=1769892023\" width=940 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/199821262af5cae4baf8d1fc3dd6825d.webm?t=1769892023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/199821262af5cae4baf8d1fc3dd6825d.mp4?t=1769892023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face relentless waves of enemies and master fast, action\u2011packed runs!\u00a0</strong>Choose your faction, pick your class, and fight your way through dynamically generated levels all the way to the final boss.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer: Co\u2011op and Versus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co\u2011op (up to 4 players):</strong><br>Team up and try to clear all levels together. The host selects the faction, and each player chooses one of four available classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus (up to 4\u202fvs\u202f4):</strong><br>Compete against each other in fast-paced matches. All classes are available for both teams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Factions, Eight Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between <strong>Drones</strong> and <strong>Monsters</strong>, each offering four classes with unique playstyles and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/4d51187ba9b842a2a57ddb8cfce01a7a.avif?t=1769892023\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras_big/4d51187ba9b842a2a57ddb8cfce01a7a.avif?t=1769892023 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Asymmetric Enemy Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles are asymmetric:\u00a0Your enemies are the classes from the opposing faction.\u00a0Each wave challenges you differently and forces you to adapt your build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sandbox-Modus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock classes and abilities in the regular mode, then <strong>create your own custom builds</strong> and experiment freely in the Sandbox.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Paths and Biomes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unique:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps and levels are randomly assembled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 biomes that affect each faction differently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boss fight awaits at the end of every chapter</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/61b6c453989a4301fb79855e115a68d4.poster.avif?t=1769892023\" width=940 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/61b6c453989a4301fb79855e115a68d4.webm?t=1769892023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/61b6c453989a4301fb79855e115a68d4.mp4?t=1769892023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use upgrades to stay ahead of the ever\u2011growing enemy waves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five difficulty modes:\u00a0From beginner\u2011friendly to <strong>brutal bullet hell</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with accessibility in mind:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable ability colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully remappable controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto\u2011aim and auto\u2011attack (playable one\u2011handed)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate audio sliders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty options</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 factions, each with 4 classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox mode for own class creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Path-based progression with dynamic level generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades for your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koop and versus</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Drone Killer I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3968430/f4ae50be6c40232746c4bff7cb4b5951357bb5f7.jpg"},{"name":"Drone Killer II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3968430/8cac22c76717d12bd9bbc07113e439b8b296994a.jpg"},{"name":"Drone Killer III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3968430/4ff6f33d8ba6c1d359c2bd059da02f530f0eb296.jpg"},{"name":"Drone Killer IV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3968430/209a6298cfadec90bbfcee8517799ffa8f47df3f.jpg"},{"name":"Drone Killer V","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3968430/a983fd8020a2dee26f0aa8b41d69a265a1a71604.jpg"},{"name":"Monster Hunter I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3968430/386af500b3074fff2c7bc703721acad155b11c8b.jpg"},{"name":"Monster Hunter II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.