y in mind:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable ability colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully remappable controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto\u2011aim and auto\u2011attack (playable one\u2011handed)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate audio sliders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty options</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 factions, each with 4 classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox mode for own class creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Path-based progression with dynamic level generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades for your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koop and versus</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["BaroxxTech"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/452536eefa1de6162a47738138b44d24d088edb0/header.jpg?t=1769892023","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Latest SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 / AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3968430/53923914/444f5f6531a97e663781810ee2ae607ab0bfcb84/1764029255/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764030469","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3968430/53923914/444f5f6531a97e663781810ee2ae607ab0bfcb84/1764029255/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764030469","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https